{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>將軍澳今日（11日）發生修車意外。下午2時57分，警方接報獲途人報案，指在將軍澳上村發現一名男子疑在維修私家車時，被私家車壓在車底。</p><p>救援人員趕至，發現男事主已陷昏迷，將他救出及送往將軍澳醫院搶救。警方正調查事件起因。</p><figure><img alt=\"事主昏迷被送到將軍澳醫院搶救。（資料相片/翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261102/1193856118154072064537102.jpeg/JqRfZsTtLGEKCjOk8uZ9g0YlKllo-qJM8rDJ3fKwyd0\"/><figcaption>事主昏迷被送到將軍澳醫院搶救。（資料相片/翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T08:14:47.165887+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":136,"images":1,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T08:04:29+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T08:28:34.178732+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T08:08:18.411338+00:00","content_hash":"2b05a75745fca72230e739b583cdd4e9cac36a6a38e885393daab3edc475b8cd","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}